---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Card from '../components/Card.astro';
import Pill from '../components/Pill.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Blog — Rostislav Nagimov | Systems & Performance Writeups"
  description="Technical articles, deep dives into Rust internals, zero-cost abstractions, data compression benchmarks, and system performance by Rostislav Nagimov."
>
  <main class="container">
    <Card>
      <Pill>Technical Writing</Pill>
      <h1>Blog</h1>
      <p>Deep dives on systems programming, performance optimization, and Rust internals.</p>
    </Card>

    <Card>
      <h2>Articles & Publications</h2>
      <div class="list">
        <Card class="project">
          <Pill>Encoding · Compression</Pill>
          <h2>CL-8: Однобайтовое сжатие текста</h2>
          <span><a href="/blog/cl-8/">Read article</a></span>
          <p>Сжатие кириллицы и латиницы, паритет с Unicode и бенчмарки с Brotli/gzip на «Войне и мире».</p>
        </Card>
      </div>
    </Card>
  </main>
</Base>


